Data Provenance Protocol (DPP) — License

This repository contains multiple components under different licenses.

Specification (spec/)
    CC0-1.0 — Public Domain Dedication
    The protocol specification is dedicated to the public domain.
    Everyone is free to implement, extend, and reference it without restriction.

DPP CLI (cli/)
    GPL-3.0-or-later
    The reference command-line implementation is free software: you can
    redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General
    Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation, either
    version 3 of the License, or (at your option) any later version.

Web Verification Demo (web/)
    MIT
    The browser-based verification demo is released under the MIT license,
    permitting unrestricted reuse including in proprietary software.

BIM Demonstrator (demo/bim/)
GIS Demonstrator (demo/gis/)
    License to be determined at implementation time.

